flowchart TB
  subgraph Mobile[Dispositivo]
    UI[Expo screens]
    Design[Design system]
    Domain[Domain + application]
    SQLite[(SQLite offline)]
  end
  subgraph AWS[AWS account]
    Auth[Cognito]
    API[API Gateway HTTP]
    Lambda[Lambda handlers]
    DB[(Aurora PostgreSQL + PostGIS)]
    S3[(S3 privado)]
    CDN[CloudFront]
  end
  UI --> Design
  UI --> Domain
  Domain --> SQLite
  Domain --> Auth
  Domain --> API
  API --> Lambda
  Lambda --> DB
  Lambda --> S3
  CDN --> S3
